 a Meso-Titan used by Dr. Rickman to defeat Dante Vale and steal his ancient Mayan / Aztecan bowl in the past.\n\n== History ==\n\n== Abilities ==\nSince Wendigo is a wind-like Titan, it can do wind-based attacks.\n\n==Gallery==\n\nWendigo Amulet.jpg|Wendigo's Amulet\n\n== Trivia ==\n* This Titan is based on the Wendigo, a half-beast spirit from the mythology of the Algonquian group of Native American tribes.","raw_wikitext":"{{stub}}\n{{infobox Titan\n| image      = File:Wendigo.png\n| attack     = ?\n| defense    = ?\n| type       = [[Meso-Titan]]\n| size       = \n| ability    = \n| users      = [[Dr. Rickman]]\n| height     = \n| weight     = \n| first      = \"[[Mission to Skara Brae]]\"\n| last       = \n}}\n'''Wendigo''' is a [[Meso-Titan]] used by [[Dr. Rickman]] to defeat [[Dante Vale]] and steal his ancient Mayan / Aztecan bowl in the past.\n\n== History ==\n\n== Abilities ==\nSince Wendigo is a wind-like Titan, it can do wind-based attacks.\n\n==Gallery==\n{{Gallery}}\n<gallery captionalign=\"left\">\nWendigo Amulet.jpg|Wendigo's Amulet\n</gallery>\n\n== Trivia ==\n* This Titan is based on the [[wikipedia:Wendigo|Wendigo]], a half-beast spirit from the mythology of the Algonquian group of Native American tribes.\n[[Category:Titans]]\n[[Category:Meso-Titans]]\n[[Category:Comic Titans]]\n[[Category:Organization Titans]]\n[[Category:Medium Titans]]\n{{Clear}}{{MesoBox}}","categories":["Article stubs","Comic Titans","Medium Titans","Meso-Titans","Organization Titans","Titans"],"links":[{"target_title":"Meso-Titan","label":"Meso-Titan","target_id":"huntik:page:2834","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Meso-Titan","status":"resolved","href":"#/categories?name=Meso-Titans"},{"target_title":"Dr. Rickman","label":"Dr. Rickman","target_id":"huntik:page:8577","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Dr._Rickman","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A8577"},{"target_title":"Mission to Skara Brae","label":"Mission to Skara Brae","target_id":